"""Original Xbox games that run on the Xbox 360 with a xefu emulator build.

Generated from the ConsoleMods wiki compatibility list:
    https://consolemods.org/wiki/Xbox_360:Original_Xbox_Games_Compatibility_List
Only the green results are kept: "Supported" (officially supported) and
"Playable" (very minor or no issues). In-game, Menus, Intro and Unplayable are left out.

GAMES: (name, {xefu version: (status, has_cfg)}, known issues).
has_cfg means a Config Loader xefu7 config exists for that game.
NOT_GREEN: names of the other games on the list (no green result on any version),
used only so a file name is never matched to the wrong game.
"""

