    ('Disney’s Chicken Little', {'xefu7': ('Playable', True)}, 'Playable using Config Loader xefu7 (NTSC and PAL). Crashes when trying to save the game after completing the Space Simulator II level, but you can select "Continue without saving" to move on to the next level and save the game. For all other xefus, shows 2005 Disney logo for a few seconds, then crashes. Came bundled with xefu2021b on Xbox One.'),
