    ('ExaSkeleton', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False)}, "At first, it may seem to freeze at the splash screen, but in reality it just takes a pretty long time to load (roughly a minute to reach the title screen). Seems to play fine after reaching the title screen though, apart from some noticeable input lag with the start button specifically, making it a bit hard to pause the game at times. Haven't beaten the whole game, so further testing is still needed to make sure it's fully beatable, but it seems to run best overall with the original xefu file (xefu.xex). Xefu2019 and xefu2021c both freeze at the Xbox logo. All tests were done on an NTSC console."),
