    ('Grand Theft Auto III', {'xefu': ('Supported', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Low framerate in heavy traffic areas. Resolutions higher than 480p are distorted and game runs slower than intended. Custom radio is not supported. Game runs flawlessly on xefu2021c. On Xefu2021c only extracted XEX format from ISO is compatible, not compatible with GOD or extracted from XISO, otherwise freezes with code [54540073] on Xbox logo with error popup.'),
    ('Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas', {'xefu': ('Supported', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, "Graphical glitches and artifacts in several areas and cutscenes. Audio issues including sound becoming lower or entirely silent (except for the menu) when in certain areas or during explosions, gunfire has sound issues which is noticeable with automatic weapons, and sound can sometimes skip with lip sync being off during cutscenes. Custom radio is supported by editing st.db in Hdd1:\\Compatibility\\Xbox1\\TDATA\\FFFE0000 with LoicBersier's XBST or any program that supports it. Audio issues are gone and game runs flawlessly on xefu2021c."),
    ('Grand Theft Auto: Vice City', {'xefu': ('Supported', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Low framerate in heavy traffic areas. Resolutions higher than 480p are distorted and game runs slower than intended. Custom radio is not supported. Better framerate in xefu 5. Game runs flawlessly on xefu2021c. Some conflicting reports of Xefu2021c only working with extracted XEX format from ISO, not compatible with GOD or extracted from XISO, otherwise freezes with code [54540073] on Xbox logo with error popup.'),
