    ('Gun', {'xefu7': ('Playable', True)}, 'Use Config Loader xefu7 to fix animal animations and other late game bugs.'),
    ('Gunvalkyrie', {'xefu7': ('Playable', True)}, "Use Config Loader xefu7 to fix all issues. In Xefu2 and Xefu6, everything seems normal until you actually get into the game, a very loud buzzing noise plays the moment you get into the tutorial. In Xefu 7, The game starts up fine, and plays great until the point in the tutorial where you must boost dash with L3, which doesn't work. You can use an existing save file to skip the tutorial. Same issue on xefu2019 and xefu2021a. Xefu2021c sort of works - you CAN boost dash with L3, but the entire screen turns solid red while you're dashing forward, making it far from ideal for playing; happens both on the NTSC and PAL versions. Came with xefu2021a on Xbox One. USA version save"),
