    ('Half-Life 2', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu5': ('Supported', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False)}, 'This game does not play on PAL-60 televisions with composite cabling. This does not affect PAL-50 televisions. Screen corruption in attract mode will occur after the console has been idle for a long period of time. Game launches but has horrible fps drops in certain places so far i have played a little like 2 mins into point insertion and have experienced a couple of fps drops right after getting of the train and in the vending machine section but is deffinetly playeble if you can take 15fps 1% lows every 10secs.'),
    ('Halo 2', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Supported', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Performance problems while playing on the Backwash map. Occasionally the player may observe "ghost" images displayed on the screen; a workaround for this issue is to return to the Dashboard and restart the game.'),
