    ('Need for Speed Most Wanted (2005)', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False)}, 'With xefu, xefu2, and xefu1_1, FMVs lag and low framerate sometimes during a race, but the game is playable. With all other xefus, Xbox encountered error after some races in career. Audio sometimes pops/crackles.'),
    ('Need for Speed Underground', {'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False)}, 'With xefu7 and xefu7b, FMVs lags. With xefu, xefu2, xefu3 and xefu1_1, the loading is slow. With all versions after completing 10 races, the game no longer loads. The problem occurs with NTSC and PAL. To fix this: disable autosave, after you finish a race press "Continue" and the game will ask if you wanna save the game, choose "No". After you finish playing the game, go back to "Underground Menu", go to "Save" and there you can save your progress.'),
    ('Need for Speed Underground 2', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Main game a little laggy sometimes but plays fine. Burnout 3 demo freezes a few seconds into the race, fixable using config loader xefu7.'),
