    ('OutRun 2006: Coast 2 Coast', {'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Xefu7 and most others are playable, however on "collect the coins” missions the coins aren’t rendered, only xefu2021c does this. All cores have occasional slight FPS drops and don’t correctly render the road/assets ahead in higher detail, it’s always low poly textures in the player’s viewpoint. This can be considered a limitation of the emulator itself. Initial load into the first race is very slow (minutes) due to the game loading up the virtual X,Y,Z partitions with cache data.'),
    ('OutRun 2', {'xefu6': ('Supported', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False)}, 'Audio loops occasionally get stuck. Graphics do not always stream in time around checkpoints. Performance drops during game play.'),
