    ('Pac-Man World 2', {'xefu7': ('Playable', False)}, 'Game is playable. However, it can only be played if you transfer an already saved game from an Original Xbox to the Xbox 360 HDD as you will get the "Error encountered while attempting to save" error while trying to create new save file as you cannot save the game at all, but if save is transferred from OG Xbox to 360 it is playable. You can download a saved game here Pac-Man World 2 blank save.'),
