    ('Prince of Persia: The Two Thrones', {'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, "Older xefu's: FMV don't stutter, Prince's shadow it's a square, the VFX lights remain on screen. On xefu3, freezes on the first loading. On xefu5, shadow is fixed. Up to xefu7b: All previous glitches are fixed, but FMV now stutter. Framerate drops when fighting larger groups of enemies with heavy light effects (glowing of Dark Prince's attacks). Newest xefu's: All fixed, no framedrops (I believe maybe I'm insane). On widescreen mode, FMV's are zoomed in to fit the screen (Pan and Scan)."),
    ('Prince of Persia: Warrior Within', {'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', True)}, 'Use Config Loader xefu7 to fix black screen after the Ubisoft logo (or content disclaimer screen in the Japanese version) and framerate/VFX issues. If config loader is not used, framerate issues are present on xefu 5/6/7/7b and VFX show a white screen on xefu/xefu 2. Error at Xbox logo on xefu2019, xefu2021a, xefu2021b, and xefu2021c.'),
