    ('Project Gotham Racing 2', {'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Supported', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, "With xefu3 and earlier, car select screen shows black screen, but can be worked around by flipping through cars. Transmission select screen is always black and in-game music does not play. In-game pause menu doesn't open on first try. There may be low framerate during a race."),
