    ('R: Racing Evolution', {'xefu7': ('Playable', False)}, "In the NTSC version there is a giant green circle blocking race intros and replays but they don't crash the game, while the PAL version plays normally. Framerate drops when many cars are on screen"),
    ('RalliSport Challenge', {'xefu3': ('Supported', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False)}, ''),
    ('RalliSport Challenge 2', {'xefu7': ('Playable', True)}, 'Use Config Loader xefu7 to fix flickering effects/shadows around cars and light issues mentioned later. Xefu 1/5/1_1/6 - freezes when trying to start race. Xefu 2/3 - freezes when trying to load race. Xefu 7/7b/19/21a/21b/21c - playable, but with glitched particle effects (flickering transparent triangles), replay camera ignores collisions. Freezes when trying to load penultimate race in amateur league, making the game incompletable. Xefu7 may be less stable than later versions, as vehicle select sometimes freezes game - this bug could not be replicated in later versions, but may need more testing.'),
