    ('Shrek', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', True), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, "Use Config Loader xefu7 to fix texture issues and major slowdown (minor slowdowns still present). Without it, no matter which xefu is used, the game suffers from major slowdown in various areas, and loading animation never shows. On xefu1, 1_1, 5, and 6, Shrek's character model has shadow glitches."),
