    ('Silent Hill 2: Restless Dreams', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Supported', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, "PAL version will only display a Black Screen (tested on every xefu). NTSC version is playable on every xefu, but expect texture and graphical issues. James' flashlight will always shine through his back."),
