    ('Spyro: A Hero’s Tail', {'xefu': ('Supported', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False)}, "All xefus starting with xefu2 have extremely high brightness and bloom. It doesn't seem to happen for LazyIllusion on xefu7. For xefu and xefu1_1, small glitches are seen in some UI elements, otherwise very playable, and have been beaten to 100% several times with zero issues. Credits are a black screen but music can be heard. The manual save screen is invisible, it is visible on Xefu 1_1 but I am unsure if 1_1 causes any glitches. It seems as stable as Xefu 1 from my testing so consider using it, but in case of encountering any issues remember that Xefu 1 shouldnt have any, barring the ui elements mentioned before."),
