    ('SSX Tricky', {'xefu6': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', True), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, "Use Config Loader xefu7 to fix not being able to save/load. Other testing (NTSC): xefu : Main Menu Crash xefu2 : Missing Textures like Rails, Audiences, Jumbotron etc. xefu3 : Freezed at the very start of any events xefu5 : Freezed at the very start of any events also xefu1_1 : Crashed at Start Menu xefu6 : Playable fine with some other textures slightly color saturated xefu7 : Playable and working, can't save or load xefu7b : When intro movie finished or skipped, at the main menu you hearing a stutter sound in short time but Playable in the game, but can't save or load xefu2021c : Plays fine xefu2021c, Minor screen tearing and crashes when loading a match on xefu7, Shows a broken version of the character select room then crashes xefu1"),
