    ('The Lord of the Rings: The Third Age', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Supported', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, "NTSC version plays on both NTSC and PAL consoles. PAL version hangs on Xbox logo on NTSC console and plays fine on PAL console. Some stuck sound effects after playing a while without restarting in 21. In xefu's 7b and older, the glow around chests fills the whole screen."),
    ('The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers', {'xefu7': ('Playable', True)}, 'Use Config Loader xefu7 to fix orcs falling through environment preventing level progression. Blurry heat haze graphics glitch. During credits the game crashes if your controller disconnects but this might be same issue on original Xbox.'),
