    ("Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six 3", {'xefu7': ('Playable', True)}, 'Use Config Loader xefu7 to fix low framerate in some areas of the game and visual issues in corners of screen. Must change communicator output mode setting to "Speakers only" or else some voice lines are missing. Crashes to dashboard with xefu2019 and newer.'),
