    ('Tom Clancy’s Splinter Cell Pandora Tomorrow', {'xefu2': ('Supported', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False)}, "The OG Xbox white theme, at the start of the game, seems flicker instantly a bit when the Ubisoft intro starts until it's gone and the videoclip is back to normal, but the game can still be fully played. However, during gameplay, it lags in most areas expect it's not really very laggy, and the framerate will go back smoother (similar to playing it in original Xbox) which it only works when switching to a thermal vision."),
