    ('Tony Hawk’s Pro Skater 2x', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Supported', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Runs almost perfectly on xefu1. Shadows are glitchy along with player model on xefu2/3/1_1,7b,2019-2021c. (locks to 60fps more often with xefu3 - Broken Scholar) Game in audible but not visible on xefu5/6'),
    ('Tony Hawk’s Pro Skater 3', {'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Supported', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Runs fine with 480p or 640x480 VGA in Xbox 360 Settings, otherwise audio plays while hung at Xbox logo, guide is broken. Game runs at a locked 60fps regardless of console resolution settings using xefu2019 (Recommended) or xefu2021a-c. 480p limitation applies to all other builds.'),
    ('Tony Hawk’s Pro Skater 4', {'xefu': ('Supported', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021a': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Improved performance under xefu3 (Recommended) at least.'),
    ('Tony Hawk’s Project 8', {'xefu': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Framerate closest to OG Xbox hardware and minimal top screen ghosting using xefu3 (Recommended), xefu5 and xefu6 play FMVs with sound but no video, all 2D menu/HUD elements are completely missing.'),
    ('Tony Hawk’s Underground', {'xefu7': ('Supported', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False)}, 'Minor screen tearing and framerate issues.'),
    ('Tony Hawk’s Underground 2', {'xefu': ('Supported', False), 'xefu2': ('Playable', False), 'xefu3': ('Playable', False), 'xefu1_1': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7': ('Playable', False), 'xefu7b': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2019': ('Playable', False), 'xefu2021c': ('Playable', False)}, 'Framerate issues, xefu2019 (Recommended) and 2021 improve this to a very playable status with occasional spikes, mostly from long draw distances/asset streaming (In addition, xefu3, 7, and 7b all mitigate performance issues well. 5 and 6 break FMVs and 2D UI/HUD elements).'),
