    ('Wallace and Gromit: Curse of the Were-Rabbit', {'xefu5': ('Playable', False), 'xefu6': ('Playable', False)}, 'The game is playable with some graphical glitches. All xefu have minor framedrops up to about 40 fps. xefu : FMVs are heavily distorted. xefu2 : Freeze on the Xbox logo. xefu3 : FMVs work perfectly, glitches are only available in the sky, and on sfx. In some parts of the city, texture may be lost and a white light may appear. xefu5 : FMVs work perfectly, glitches are only available in the sky, and on sfx. xefu1_1 : Sometimes when objects interact, the game freeze with a fatal error. xefu6 : FMVs work perfectly, but in rare cases there can be random freeze. xefu7 : The windows of all buildings in the town are covered with white light, FMVs are heavily distorted. In some parts of the city, texture may be lost and a white light may appear. xefu7b : FMVs are distorted, There are minor micro-freezes.'),
